sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Signed-in User
  participant F as :Frontend
  participant G as :Gems
  participant DB as :Database
  participant LF as :Live Feed
  participant OF as :Frontend (another user)

  U->>+F: open the dashboard
  F->>+G: GET /gem/newest
  G->>+DB: find the newest gems
  alt database available
    DB-->>G: gems
    G-->>F: 200 [gems]
    F-->>U: the newest gems
  else database error
    DB-->>-G: error
    G-->>-F: 500 "Get Gems failed."
    F-->>-U: "Couldn't load gems, try again"
  end

  alt location permission granted
    F-)LF: subscribe (user's location, radius)
    alt location and radius valid
      LF-)F: subscribed
    else invalid
      LF-)F: error (connection stays open)
    end
    Note over OF,G: Another user adds a gem within the radius (Add a Gem)
    OF->>+G: POST /gem
    G->>+DB: insert the gem
    DB-->>-G: inserted
    G->>+LF: publish the new gem
    LF-)F: gem.added
    LF-->>-G: done
    G-->>-OF: 201 gem
    F-)U: the new gem appears at the top of the list (no refresh)
    Note over F,LF: A rating in the area sends gem.updated the same way
  else location permission denied
    F-)U: dialog: location is needed for live updates, the list shows only the newest gems
  end
  Note over U,OF: If the server can't be reached, the Frontend shows "No connection, try again". If the live-feed connection drops, live updates stop until the app reconnects
